<title>USA: GOLF-SECOND ROUND SCORES FROM U.S. PGA TOUR.</title>
<headline>GOLF-SECOND ROUND SCORES FROM U.S. PGA TOUR.</headline>
<dateline>NEW ORLEANS 1997-04-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Leading second-round</p>
<p>scores from the $1.5 million Freeport-McDermott Classic at</p>
<p>English Turn G.C. on Friday (players U.S. unless noted):</p>
<p>134 Larry Rinker 65 69, Scott McCarron 65 69</p>
<p>137 Brad Faxon 68 69, Michael Christie 70 67</p>
<p>138 Lanny Wadkins 69 69, David Toms 65 73</p>
<p>139 Jose Maria Olazabal (Spain) 72 67, Neal Lancaster 68 71</p>
<p>140 Kirk Triplett 72 68, Davis Love 69 71, Billy Mayfair 68</p>
<p>72, Brian Henninger 69 71, Bob Tway 68 72, Scott Hoch 68 72,</p>
<p>Hideki Kase (Japan) 66 74</p>
<p>141 Brad Bryant 71 70, Duffy Waldorf 70 71, Peter Jacobsen 70</p>
<p>71, Russ Cochran 70 71, Greg Norman (Australia) 67 74, Jesper</p>
<p>Parnevik (Sweden) 72 69</p>
<p>Other international players:</p>
<p>143 Yoshinori Kaneko (Japan) 69 74, Steve Elkington</p>
<p>(Australia) 71 72</p>
<p>144 Grant Waite (New Zealand) 73 71</p>
<p>146 Wayne Grady (Australia) 73 73</p>
<p>149 Bradley Hughes (Australia) 68 81</p>
<p>151 Phil Tataurangi (New Zealand) 72 79</p>
<p>153 Per-Ulrik Johansson (Sweden) 82 71</p>
<p>157 Rafael Alarcon (Mexico) 82 75, Gabriel Hjerstedt (Sweden)</p>
<p>75 82</p>
